[13.046664, "o", "# PR #204: Fix gold/silver discount calculation\r\n\r\n**alice** (maintainer) commented:\r\n> Confirmed the bug — `apply_discount` subtracts the percent as a flat\r\n"]
[13.047522, "o", "> dollar amount instead of applying it as a percentage. Please change it to\r\n> `price * (1 - percent / 100)`. That's the only change needed here, nothing\r\n> else in this PR.\r\n"]
[13.048776, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@34cd20e424cf:/app# "]
